/**
 * @module
 * Code generation: AIR to textual LLVM IR (ADR 0001), accepted by LLVM 17
 * and later (stage 0: bootstrap/src/codegen/llvm*.c).
 *
 * Each AIR local is an `alloca` in the entry block (`%l<N>`); LLVM's mem2reg
 * promotes them to registers. SSA temporaries are `%t<N>`. String literals,
 * source locations and intrinsic declarations are collected while the
 * functions are generated and written after them. An enum is
 * `{ i32 tag, [K x i64] payload }`: the payload is large enough for the
 * largest variant, each variant being a struct of its fields laid over it.
 */

